ars, 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years. In 2025 that middle saw August to September at 61% of normal. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 47% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value.</p>"}
